        "tag": "main",
        "text": "53.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 333.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose the best word to complete each sentence."
      },
      {
        "y": 87.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 513.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Anorexia is a serious eating effect / disorder in which a person tries to eat as little as possible."
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 427.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 The doctor asked me a lot of questions about my medical history / story."
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 450.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Far more children these days are asthmatic / allergic to nuts than ever before."
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 485.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 It is important not to overtake / exceed the number of pills the doctor tells you to take."
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 454.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Talk to your pharmacist if you suffer any side / adverse reactions to the tablets."
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 315.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 My grandfather had a bowel / stroke last year."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 412.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 Doctors use the word stools but children talk about poo / excrement."
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 256.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 If you vomit, you feel / are sick."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 391.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 Disorientation / Disease can be the result of a bang on the head."
      },
      {
        "y": 195.8,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 413.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 Maria is not allowed to drive for the duration / dose of her treatment."
      },
      {
        "y": 211.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "53.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 214.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 496.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Replace the underlined expressions with one of the metaphors from B. Make any other"
      },
      {
        "y": 226.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 201.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "necessary changes."
      },
      {
        "y": 243.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 428.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Excitement grew extremely strong as the day of the final match dawned."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 467.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Although industry is doing well in the north of the country, in the south it is weak."
      },
      {
        "y": 267.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 514.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The manager said that there had been a sudden large number of complaints about the hotel."
      },
      {
        "y": 279.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 404.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Unfortunately, she is still affected in a negative way by her divorce."
      },
      {
        "y": 291.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 502.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 The problems we have experienced in our neighbourhood are evidence of wider problems"
      },
      {
        "y": 303.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 169.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "in society."
      },
      {
        "y": 315.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 361.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 What do you think the prospects are for the peace talks?"
      },
      {
        "y": 327.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 478.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 I voted for the Green Party because they seem to be in touch with what’s happening."
      },
      {
        "y": 339.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 376.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The business has been having problems for some time now."
      },
      {
        "y": 351.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 391.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 I’m afraid I have rather a sceptical view of the banking industry."
      },
      {
        "y": 367.2,
